2026-05-01 16:38:08,692 - INFO - {'messages': [HumanMessage(content='Sub-task 6/8: Generate the Power BI starter (PBIP).\n\nBuild under "starter/":\n  - Assessment.pbip\n  - Assessment.SemanticModel/.platform  (type "SemanticModel", version "2.0")\n  - Assessment.SemanticModel/definition.pbism\n  - Assessment.SemanticModel/definition/model.tmdl, database.tmdl\n  - Assessment.SemanticModel/definition/tables/<Entity>.tmdl  (one per entity,\n    types declared, NO relationships, NO measures)\n  - Assessment.Report/.platform  (type "Report", version "2.0")\n  - Assessment.Report/definition.pbir\n  - Assessment.Report/report.json (one empty page)\n  - Assessment.Report/StaticResources/SharedResources/BaseThemes/theme.json\n\nNOTE: The .platform files are required by Power BI Desktop to identify\nartifact types. Without them the project will not open.\nEach .platform file must be valid JSON with schema, metadata.type,\nmetadata.displayName, config.version, and config.logicalId (any UUID).\n\nTables connect to ../data/*.csv via Csv.Document with relative paths.\n\nValidate every JSON file with validate_json before finishing.\nThen call mark_subtask_complete.\n', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content=[{'text': "I'll build the PBIP starter structure. Let me start by creating all the required files.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_012fXvdL6y1v5hbKkpuTGaNE', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {'path': 'starter/Assessment.pbip', 'content': '{\n  "version": "1.0",\n  "artifacts": [\n    {\n      "report": {\n        "path": "Assessment.Report"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  "settings": {\n    "enableAutoRecovery": true\n  }\n}\n'}, 'name': 'write_file', 'type': 'tool_use'}, {'id': 'toolu_01LNjGYgdc7WK3iKxZtzm2M6', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {'path': 'starter/Assessment.SemanticModel/.platform', 'content': '{\n  "$schema": "https://developer.microsoft.com/json-schemas/fabric/gitIntegration/platformProperties/2.0.0/schema.json",\n  "metadata": {