2026-05-01 17:01:22,424 - INFO - {'messages': [HumanMessage(content='Sub-task 5/8: Generate the data script.\n\nStep 1 — read brief/data_schema.json and brief/candidate_brief.md to understand\nthe schema, traps, and scenario context.\n\nStep 2 — write ONE file only: "starter/generate_data.py". No probe or test scripts.\nScript requirements:\n  - First two lines after imports: random.seed(42) and np.random.seed(42)\n  - Anchor output path with:\n        HERE = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n        OUT_DIR = os.path.join(HERE, "data")\n        os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n    This guarantees CSVs land in starter/data/ regardless of working directory.\n  - Generate all entity CSVs (from the schema) into OUT_DIR — 300-800 rows each\n  - Never read from disk at runtime; all data is generated programmatically\n  - Guarantee referential integrity (every FK value resolves to a PK)\n  - Faithfully inject every trap documented in the schema\n\nStep 3 — run with run_python("starter/generate_data.py") and check stdout for errors.\n\nStep 4 — verify FK integrity with validate_csv_integrity for the main\nfact-to-dimension relationship.\n\nOnly call mark_subtask_complete after validation passes.\n', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), AIMessage(content=[{'text': "I'll start by reading the brief and schema to understand what needs to be generated.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_01YAMdjuQ6oMZwPQomNbz4ZT', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {'path': 'brief/data_schema.json'}, 'name': 'read_file', 'type': 'tool_use'}, {'id': 'toolu_01JaJzzhVQTn1XigbNGrhCWg', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {'path': 'brief/candidate_brief.md'}, 'name': 'read_file', 'type': 'tool_use'}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'id': 'msg_01AmSa3Bftrpj7mDumxF1eUw', 'container': None, 'model': 'claude-opus-4-7', 'stop_details': None, 'stop_reason': 'tool_use', 'stop_sequence': None, 'usage': {'cache_creation': {'ephemeral_1h_input_tokens': 0, 'ephemeral_5m_inpu